  "notes": "FORMS:\n{爆|ばく} (explode) + {撃|げき} (strike, attack). Can also function as a する verb: {爆撃|ばくげき}する (to bomb).\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {空襲|くうしゅう}: air raid — focuses on the aerial nature of the attack\n- {爆撃|ばくげき}: bombing — specifically emphasizes the use of bombs\n- {砲撃|ほうげき}: bombardment with artillery, not from aircraft\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {爆撃|ばくげき}を{受|う}ける: be bombed\n- {爆撃|ばくげき}する: to bomb\n- {爆撃機|ばくげきき}: bomber (aircraft)\n- {無差別|むさべつ}{爆撃|ばくげき}: indiscriminate bombing",
